    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="57.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 57.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">7 we willað, þæt ælc Rompæni beo gelæst be Petres mæssan to ðam bisceopstole.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And it is our will that every Rome-penny is to be paid to the bishop's see by St Peter's day.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">And we ordain that all dues to Rome are to be paid to the episcopal see by St. Peter's day.</ab>
      </div>
